// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch20 U08 "Thank you." (C, 2 min). act3_ch20.md §2 U08. The four founders fall one by
// one, each saying thank you. The last, Cael Imbrey, says it to Asha and then, looking past her down the well, names
// nobody (rule 5: Imra and Dace are not seen or named in Ch20). The Cage's bars are bound light; when it breaks THE
// FOUNDERS DON'T LIFT YET (only the Vowbound release in Ch20: rule 2). They lie in the dark water, held, waiting for
// H09. §10 Q6: cut Cael's second line if Cinematics wants silence.
title: ch20_thank_you
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U29
@music thank_you fade=1.0
Orin_tesk as "Orin Tesk" [tender]: Thank you. #line:ch20_thanks_001
@wait 2.0
Halde_moor as "Halde Moor" [tender]: Thank you. #line:ch20_thanks_002
@wait 2.0
Isse_varan as "Isse Varan" [tender]: Thank you. #line:ch20_thanks_003
@wait 3.0
@camera U30
Cael_imbrey as "Cael Imbrey" [tender]: Thank you. #line:ch20_thanks_004
@anim cael_imbrey look_at well_down
@wait 3.0
Cael_imbrey as "Cael Imbrey" [neutral]: She's waiting for you. Both of them are. #line:ch20_thanks_005
@vfx glimmer_held at=founders count=4
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch20_complete = true>>
@fade out 2.0
@letterbox off
===
